# Stage G4 field gate: does the tilted deviatoric eigenstrain actually leave a
# shear stress at the dislocation glide planes after relaxation?
#
# The Stage G diagnosis showed that under p p f a laterally uniform eigenstrained
# slab relaxes sigma_zz to ~0 by simply getting taller. The same equilibrium
# argument (d sigma_xz/dz = 0 with a traction-free top) can null the SHEAR
# component too, leaving only the ridge shape differential. This gate measures
